        "key": "DESC",
        "value": "As part of their guerilla warfare activities, Steel Falcons learn how to use the natural environment to create traps. The Steel Falcon gains Learn Ranger Trap as a bonus feat (she does not need to meet the feat's normal prerequisite of 5 ranks in Survival). As per the rules for that feat, she learns one extraordinary ranger trap (chosen from the following: alarm trap, burning trap, exploding trap, fire trap, marking trap, poison trap, snare trap, and swarm trap). The number of times she can use a trap is %1.|SteelFalconLVL+WIS"
